@startuml coupon-operator-revoke-activity
title 紧急撤销用户券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|运营|

start

:选择模板;

:填写撤销原因;

:提交撤销;

|优惠券服务|

:校验模板与原因;

:批量撤销可撤销用户券;

if (存在不可撤销券?) then (是)
  :跳过并记录;
else (否)
endif

:记录撤销流水;

|数据库|

:更新用户券状态\n并写入流水;

stop

@enduml
